OL,3,CTaoiseach defends judiciary system
OL,4,Camid unionist backlash over bomb case
OL,5,CBail
OL,7,FTaoiseach Micheal Martin has said
OL,8,Funionist parties criticising the
OL,9,Fbailing of a trainee solicitor charged
OL,10,Fin relation to a bomb intercepted in a
OL,11,Fcar near the Irish border should
OL,12,F"respect the independence of our
OL,13,Fjudicial system".
OL,26,@oD@PrptD@AOUuD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/10
