OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785417510
OL,3,CTaoiseach defends judiciary system
OL,4,Camid unionist backlash over bomb case
OL,5,CBail
OL,7,FThe DUP, UUP and TUV have criticised
OL,8,Fthe decision made by a judge in
OL,9,FIreland to grant bail to Isobella
OL,10,FPerrie Sullivan, 25, of Abbeylands
OL,11,FPark, Clane, Co Kildare, who was
OL,12,Fcharged with possession of explosives
OL,13,Fat a special sitting of Trim District
OL,14,FCourt in Co Meath last week.
OL,16,FAt that hearing, her defence solicitor
OL,17,Fsaid she had been asked to take a bag
OL,18,Fto the north and had not been aware
OL,19,Fwhat was in it, adding that she had
OL,20,Fbeen "manipulated".
OL,26,@|D@FOU|D@RO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/10
