PN,41504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785417510
OL,3,CTaoiseach defends judiciary system
OL,4,Camid unionist backlash over bomb case
OL,5,CBail
OL,7,FIn court on Friday, Ms Perrie Sullivan
OL,8,Fwas granted bail with a host of
OL,9,Fconditions, which included a 15,000-
OL,10,Feuro independent surety, that she
OL,11,Fsurrendered her passport, stays at an
OL,12,Faddress approved by gardai with a
OL,13,Fcurfew of 9pm to 7am, has a mobile
OL,14,Fphone available 24 hours a day and
OL,15,Fsigns in each day to Naas garda
OL,16,Fstation.
OL,18,FGardai also requested another
OL,19,Fcondition, that she not have any
OL,20,Fcontact with anyone in Saoradh or the
OL,21,FNew IRA.
OL,26,@tD@ZrtzD@Frt
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/10
