PN,41505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785417510
OL,3,CTaoiseach defends judiciary system
OL,4,Camid unionist backlash over bomb case
OL,5,CBail
OL,7,FDUP leader Gavin Robinson announced
OL,8,Fthat he had written to the Irish
OL,9,FJustice Minister in relation to the
OL,10,Fcase, saying in a statement on social
OL,11,Fmedia: "The people of Northern Ireland
OL,12,Fhave lived through the devastating
OL,13,Fconsequences of terrorism.
OL,15,F"We know only too well the destruction
OL,16,Fthat explosive devices can cause.
OL,26,@sD@HOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785417510
OL,3,CTaoiseach defends judiciary system
OL,4,Camid unionist backlash over bomb case
OL,5,CBail
OL,7,F"Decisions of this nature inevitably
OL,8,Fundermine public confidence and leave
OL,9,Fmany people asking whether sufficient
OL,10,Fweight is being given to the
OL,11,Fseriousness of these offences."
OL,13,FUUP leader Jon Burrows also expressed
OL,14,Fhis intention to write to the Justice
OL,15,FMinister saying: "Public confidence in
OL,16,Fthe justice system depends not only on
OL,17,Fjustice being done but on it being
OL,18,Fseen to be done.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@_O]wD@ROU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785417510
OL,3,CTaoiseach defends judiciary system
OL,4,Camid unionist backlash over bomb case
OL,5,CBail
OL,7,F"Decisions in cases involving alleged
OL,8,Fterrorist offences must reassure the
OL,9,Fpublic that the threat is being
OL,10,Ftreated with the utmost seriousness."
OL,12,FTUV MLA Timothy Gaston said the
OL,13,Fdecision to grant bail "in a case
OL,14,Finvolving allegations of this gravity
OL,15,Fis profoundly concerning and sends
OL,16,Fentirely the wrong message".
OL,18,F"Those of us living in Northern
OL,19,FIreland know only too well what Semtex
OL,20,Fin the hands of Republican terrorists
OL,21,Fcan mean," he said.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@eO]uD@XOUxD@[O]zD@AOU}D@JO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785417510
OL,3,CTaoiseach defends judiciary system
OL,4,Camid unionist backlash over bomb case
OL,5,CBail
OL,7,F"It is therefore entirely reasonable
OL,8,Fto ask how the interests of public
OL,9,Fsafety are served by granting bail to
OL,10,Fsomeone accused of possessing such
OL,11,Fmaterial."
OL,13,FAsked about the bail decision on
OL,14,FWednesday, the Irish premier paid
OL,15,Ftribute to the Gardai and said those
OL,16,Fcriticising the active case should
OL,17,F"respect the independence" of
OL,18,FIreland's legal system.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@JO]wD@UrtyD@AOUyD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
