PN,41509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785417510
OL,3,CTaoiseach defends judiciary system
OL,4,Camid unionist backlash over bomb case
OL,5,CBail
OL,7,FSpeaking to reporters in Dublin Mr
OL,8,FMartin said: "In the first instance I
OL,9,Fwould pay tribute to the Gardai and
OL,10,Fthey made timely intervention in
OL,11,Frespect of stopping and obviously
OL,12,Fpreventing perhaps a significant
OL,13,Fattack.
OL,15,F"Gardai have done food work here,
OL,16,Fthere's a case now that we have to
OL,17,Fawait the outcome of that.
OL,19,F"We should respect the independence of
OL,20,Fthe judiciary.
OL,26,@pD@NOUqD@_rtwD@AOUwD@Grt{D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G9/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
