CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785417510
OL,3,CTaoiseach defends judiciary system
OL,4,Camid unionist backlash over bomb case
OL,5,CBail
OL,7,F"We do, both in Northern Ireland and
OL,8,Fin the Republic, so I think those
OL,9,Fparties should also respect the
OL,10,Findependence of our judicial system
OL,11,Fand the local judicial system."
